From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abrowser <abrowser@example.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Bridge browser input and navigation

Integrates abrowser input handling with headless Chromium:
1. Sets up input thread listening for terminal events
2. Forwards mouse events using ForwardMouseEvent (trusted events)
3. Forwards keyboard events using ForwardKeyboardEvent
4. Handles navigation, scroll, and resize events

Key: Uses ForwardMouseEvent/ForwardKeyboardEvent for trusted input
events that work even on sites checking event.isTrusted.
---
